To make a zip into a self-extracting zip executable,
	cat pkg/dos/UNZIPSFX.EXE FILENAME.zip > FILENAME.exe
	zip -A FILENAME.exe

UNZIPSFX.EXE was compiled using Watcom C via 'wmake -f msdos/makefile.wat'
in the unpacked
	https://pilotfiber.dl.sourceforge.net/project/infozip/UnZip%206.x%20%28latest%29/UnZip%206.0/unzip60.tar.gz?viasf=1&fid=976c3ed19f4a77d2&e=1786478170&st=29A7V2tqssNnAbJcLV-F1g
on https://sourceforge.net/projects/infozip/postdownload
